#: lib/retro_hex_chat/services/nick_email.ex:79
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Somebody added this address to the RetroHexChat nickname %{nickname}. Open this link to confirm it:\n\n%{link}\n\nIf this was not you, ignore this message — nothing has changed and the address will stay unconfirmed."
msgstr "有人把这个地址加到了 RetroHexChat 昵称 %{nickname} 上。打开这个链接确认：\n\n%{link}\n\n如果不是你，忽略这封信即可——什么都没有改变，地址仍然未确认。"


#: lib/retro_hex_chat/services/nick_email.ex:150
